---
import { SUPPORT_EMAIL } from '../config';
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';

// Steps and labels match the app: Profile tab → Account → "Delete account" → "Delete for good"
// (src/account/AccountSection.tsx and src/i18n.ts on the app's GitHub main, 2026-11-25).
---

<Legal
  locale="en"
  path="/delete-account"
  title="Delete your account"
  description="How to delete your Riffu account and all of its data, in the app or by email."
>
  <h2>In the app</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>
      Open Riffu and go to the <strong>Profile</strong> tab.
    </li>
    <li>
      In the <strong>Account</strong> section, tap <strong>Delete account</strong>.
    </li>
    <li>
      Confirm with <strong>Delete for good</strong>.
    </li>
  </ol>
  <p>
    It happens straight away and cannot be undone. Riffu then forgets you on that phone, as if you
    had signed out.
  </p>

  <h2>If you have Pro, cancel it first</h2>
  <p>
    Deleting your account does not stop Apple from charging you. Cancel the subscription first: open
    your iPhone's Settings, tap your name, then <strong>Subscriptions</strong>. The app reminds you
    of this before it deletes the account.
  </p>

  <h2>What is deleted</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your account and its email address.</li>
    <li>Your name, if you shared it through Sign in with Apple.</li>
    <li>Your course progress: instrument, lessons, XP, streak and daily goal.</li>
    <li>
      If you used Sign in with Apple, Riffu asks Apple to remove its access to your Apple ID. If
      Riffu still appears under Sign in with Apple in your Apple ID settings, you can remove it
      there.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Copies may remain in our providers' backups for a limited time until they are overwritten. Apple
    and RevenueCat keep their own records of purchases, under their own policies.
  </p>

  <h2>If you cannot open the app</h2>
  <p>
    Write to <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}?subject=Delete%20my%20account`}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>{' '}
    from your account's email address, with the subject "Delete my account". We delete it within 30
    days and reply when it is done. If you used Sign in with Apple with a private relay address,
    write from the address that forwards to it, or tell us which address you used.
  </p>

  <h2>Without an account</h2>
  <p>
    If you never created an account, your progress lives only on your phone. Deleting the app
    deletes it.
  </p>

  <p>
    More about your data in the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
